  "notes": "Brahms Op.49 No.4 vocal line (Wikipedia score, E-flat major) transposed down a minor 3rd to C; grace notes in bars 12 and 15 omitted. Pickup = two eighths (1 beat); final bar 2 beats. Rests in bars 2, 6, 8 are Brahms's. LH one dotted-half bass per bar: I I V7 V7 V7 V7 V7 I | IV I6 V7 I | IV I6 V7 I (E3 under bars 10/14 avoids parallel 12ths after the F3 bar). Dotted-quarter + eighth in bars 1 and 3 is intrinsic."
